*PPD-Adobe: "4.3"
*%
*% PPD file for Epilog Zing 24 Laser Engraver
*% For use with macOS CUPS printing system
*%

*FormatVersion: "4.3"
*FileVersion: "1.0"
*LanguageVersion: English
*LanguageEncoding: ISOLatin1
*PCFileName: "EPLZING24.PPD"
*Manufacturer: "Epilog"
*Product: "(Epilog Zing 24)"
*ModelName: "Epilog Zing 24"
*ShortNickName: "Epilog Zing 24"
*NickName: "Epilog Zing 24 Laser Engraver"
*PSVersion: "(3010.000) 0"
*LanguageLevel: "3"
*ColorDevice: False
*DefaultColorSpace: Gray
*FileSystem: False
*Throughput: "1"
*TTRasterizer: Type42
*1284DeviceID: "MFG:Epilog;MDL:Zing 24;CMD:PJL,PCL,HPGL;"

*% Filter declaration - CUPS raster filter
*cupsFilter: "application/vnd.cups-raster 100 rastertoepiloz"

*% Supported resolutions (from EpilogZing.java)
*OpenUI *Resolution/Resolution: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 10 AnySetup *Resolution
*DefaultResolution: 500dpi
*Resolution 100dpi/100 DPI: "<</HWResolution[100 100]>>setpagedevice"
*Resolution 200dpi/200 DPI: "<</HWResolution[200 200]>>setpagedevice"
*Resolution 250dpi/250 DPI: "<</HWResolution[250 250]>>setpagedevice"
*Resolution 400dpi/400 DPI: "<</HWResolution[400 400]>>setpagedevice"
*Resolution 500dpi/500 DPI (Recommended): "<</HWResolution[500 500]>>setpagedevice"
*Resolution 1000dpi/1000 DPI: "<</HWResolution[1000 1000]>>setpagedevice"
*CloseUI: *Resolution

*% Raster Power (1-100%)
*OpenUI *RasterPower/Raster Power: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 20 AnySetup *RasterPower
*DefaultRasterPower: 100
*RasterPower 10/10%: ""
*RasterPower 20/20%: ""
*RasterPower 30/30%: ""
*RasterPower 40/40%: ""
*RasterPower 50/50%: ""
*RasterPower 60/60%: ""
*RasterPower 70/70%: ""
*RasterPower 80/80%: ""
*RasterPower 90/90%: ""
*RasterPower 100/100%: ""
*CloseUI: *RasterPower

*% Raster Speed (1-100%)
*OpenUI *RasterSpeed/Raster Speed: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 21 AnySetup *RasterSpeed
*DefaultRasterSpeed: 100
*RasterSpeed 10/10%: ""
*RasterSpeed 20/20%: ""
*RasterSpeed 30/30%: ""
*RasterSpeed 40/40%: ""
*RasterSpeed 50/50%: ""
*RasterSpeed 60/60%: ""
*RasterSpeed 70/70%: ""
*RasterSpeed 80/80%: ""
*RasterSpeed 90/90%: ""
*RasterSpeed 100/100%: ""
*CloseUI: *RasterSpeed

*% Vector Power (0-100%)
*OpenUI *VectorPower/Vector Power: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 22 AnySetup *VectorPower
*DefaultVectorPower: 100
*VectorPower 0/0% (Off): ""
*VectorPower 10/10%: ""
*VectorPower 20/20%: ""
*VectorPower 30/30%: ""
*VectorPower 40/40%: ""
*VectorPower 50/50%: ""
*VectorPower 60/60%: ""
*VectorPower 70/70%: ""
*VectorPower 80/80%: ""
*VectorPower 90/90%: ""
*VectorPower 100/100%: ""
*CloseUI: *VectorPower

*% Vector Speed (1-100%)
*OpenUI *VectorSpeed/Vector Speed: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 23 AnySetup *VectorSpeed
*DefaultVectorSpeed: 100
*VectorSpeed 10/10%: ""
*VectorSpeed 20/20%: ""
*VectorSpeed 30/30%: ""
*VectorSpeed 40/40%: ""
*VectorSpeed 50/50%: ""
*VectorSpeed 60/60%: ""
*VectorSpeed 70/70%: ""
*VectorSpeed 80/80%: ""
*VectorSpeed 90/90%: ""
*VectorSpeed 100/100%: ""
*CloseUI: *VectorSpeed

*% Vector Frequency (1-5000 Hz)
*OpenUI *VectorFrequency/Vector Frequency: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 24 AnySetup *VectorFrequency
*DefaultVectorFrequency: 5000
*VectorFrequency 500/500 Hz: ""
*VectorFrequency 1000/1000 Hz: ""
*VectorFrequency 2000/2000 Hz: ""
*VectorFrequency 2500/2500 Hz: ""
*VectorFrequency 3000/3000 Hz: ""
*VectorFrequency 4000/4000 Hz: ""
*VectorFrequency 5000/5000 Hz: ""
*CloseUI: *VectorFrequency

*% Job Type
*OpenUI *JobType/Job Type: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 25 AnySetup *JobType
*DefaultJobType: Combined
*JobType Raster/Raster Only: ""
*JobType Vector/Vector Only: ""
*JobType Combined/Combined (Raster + Vector): ""
*CloseUI: *JobType

*% Raster Mode (1-bit bitmap vs 8-bit greyscale 3D)
*OpenUI *RasterMode/Raster Mode: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 26 AnySetup *RasterMode
*DefaultRasterMode: Bitmap
*RasterMode Bitmap/Standard (1-bit): "<</cupsBitsPerColor 1 /cupsBitsPerPixel 1 /cupsColorOrder 0 /cupsColorSpace 3>>setpagedevice"
*RasterMode Greyscale3D/3D Greyscale (8-bit): "<</cupsBitsPerColor 8 /cupsBitsPerPixel 8 /cupsColorOrder 0 /cupsColorSpace 3>>setpagedevice"
*CloseUI: *RasterMode

*% Engrave Direction
*OpenUI *EngraveBottomUp/Engrave Direction: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 27 AnySetup *EngraveBottomUp
*DefaultEngraveBottomUp: false
*EngraveBottomUp false/Top to Bottom: ""
*EngraveBottomUp true/Bottom to Top: ""
*CloseUI: *EngraveBottomUp

*% Autofocus
*OpenUI *AutoFocus/Auto Focus: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 28 AnySetup *AutoFocus
*DefaultAutoFocus: false
*AutoFocus false/Off: ""
*AutoFocus true/On: ""
*CloseUI: *AutoFocus

*% Page size - Zing 24 bed: 24" x 12" = 1728 x 864 points
*OpenUI *PageSize/Page Size: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 30 AnySetup *PageSize
*DefaultPageSize: Zing24Bed
*PageSize Zing24Bed/Zing 24 Full Bed (24" x 12"): "<</PageSize[1728 864]>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize Letter/US Letter (8.5" x 11"): "<</PageSize[612 792]>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize Legal/US Legal (8.5" x 14"): "<</PageSize[612 1008]>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize Tabloid/Tabloid (11" x 17"): "<</PageSize[792 1224]>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize A4/A4 (210mm x 297mm): "<</PageSize[595 842]>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize A3/A3 (297mm x 420mm): "<</PageSize[842 1191]>>setpagedevice"
*CloseUI: *PageSize

*OpenUI *PageRegion/Page Region: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 31 AnySetup *PageRegion
*DefaultPageRegion: Zing24Bed
*PageRegion Zing24Bed/Zing 24 Full Bed (24" x 12"): "<</PageSize[1728 864]>>setpagedevice"
*PageRegion Letter/US Letter (8.5" x 11"): "<</PageSize[612 792]>>setpagedevice"
*PageRegion Legal/US Legal (8.5" x 14"): "<</PageSize[612 1008]>>setpagedevice"
*PageRegion Tabloid/Tabloid (11" x 17"): "<</PageSize[792 1224]>>setpagedevice"
*PageRegion A4/A4 (210mm x 297mm): "<</PageSize[595 842]>>setpagedevice"
*PageRegion A3/A3 (297mm x 420mm): "<</PageSize[842 1191]>>setpagedevice"
*CloseUI: *PageRegion

*DefaultImageableArea: Zing24Bed
*ImageableArea Zing24Bed: "0 0 1728 864"
*ImageableArea Letter: "0 0 612 792"
*ImageableArea Legal: "0 0 612 1008"
*ImageableArea Tabloid: "0 0 792 1224"
*ImageableArea A4: "0 0 595 842"
*ImageableArea A3: "0 0 842 1191"

*DefaultPaperDimension: Zing24Bed
*PaperDimension Zing24Bed: "1728 864"
*PaperDimension Letter: "612 792"
*PaperDimension Legal: "612 1008"
*PaperDimension Tabloid: "792 1224"
*PaperDimension A4: "595 842"
*PaperDimension A3: "842 1191"

*% Custom page size support
*MaxMediaWidth: "1728"
*MaxMediaHeight: "864"
*HWMargins: 0 0 0 0
*CustomPageSize True: "pop pop pop <</PageSize[5 -2 roll]>>setpagedevice"
*ParamCustomPageSize Width: 1 points 72 1728
*ParamCustomPageSize Height: 2 points 72 864
*ParamCustomPageSize WidthOffset: 3 points 0 0
*ParamCustomPageSize HeightOffset: 4 points 0 0
*ParamCustomPageSize Orientation: 5 int 0 0

*% Font support (minimal - we primarily do raster)
*DefaultFont: Courier
*Font Courier: Standard "(001.000)" Standard ROM
*Font Courier-Bold: Standard "(001.000)" Standard ROM

*% End of PPD
